<section class="pf-panel pf-stats-panel" id="panel-stats" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-stats" hidden><div class="pf-card"><header class="pf-heading"><h2><svg class="pf-svg" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ld-trophy" /></svg> Level Progression &amp; Learning Milestones</h2><p class="pf-muted">Level <%: Board.Me.Level %> · <%: Board.Me.LevelTitle %> · <%: Board.Me.Points.ToString("N0") %> XP. Track your progress through each learning level.</p></header><div class="pf-roadmap" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Level progression, scroll horizontally to view all levels">
